*.log

# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#   public/narration/**        generated audio is committed so any checkout
#                              renders identically without re-running Kokoro
#   public/narration/*/.cache.json
#                              tiny hash file; keeps a fresh clone from
#                              re-synthesizing every clip
#   src/videos/*/narrationManifest.ts
#                              generated, but the durations are what the
#                              compositions time against
